{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":900,"row":{"en":"We also offer a subscription service that allows you to access our entire archive.","wo":"Am nanu itam ay abonmaa ngir may nit ki mu seet lépp ci sunu dokimaa yiñ yor.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmnagnou itam ay abonnement nguir may nitt ki mou sett lép thi sounou dokimaa yign yorr.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":901,"row":{"en":"Just use household scissors or a sharp knife to trim, then place the end on the outlet.","wo":"Jëffandikol ab siso galle wala ab paaka bu ñaww rek ngir def garnitir, te gen def catli ci gennokaay bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieufandiko ab ciseaux galle wala ab paka bou niaw rek nguir def garniture, te guen def catli si guennokaay bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":902,"row":{"en":"Vimes had been investigating a series of robberies, and he was starting to feel like he was getting nowhere.","wo":"Vimes dafa doon amal lànket ci xeeti càcc yu bari, mu dem ba yàgg daal di yëg ni day wiiri-wiiri rek.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nVimes dafa done amal lanket ci kheuti thiathe you bari mou dem ba yague daldi yeug ni day wiiri wiiri rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":903,"row":{"en":"Rubber pieces can be difficult to replace, and roof rails and fuel tank door locks can be expensive to repair or replace.","wo":"Piyeesu kawsu mën na nekk lu jafee wecci, te raayu kaw gi ak tëjukaayu reservoir mën nañu seer soo leen di defar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPiyeussou kawssou meun na neuk lou diafé wethi té rayou kaw gui ak teudioukayou reservoir meun nagnou seer soo leen di defar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":904,"row":{"en":"I shrugged It’s not the most important thing, I said But it’s definitely a factor.","wo":"Ma yëngal sama mbagg ni ko Nekkul li gëna am solo, Waaye xorom la ci.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa yeungal sama mbague ni ko Nekoul li geuna am solo wayé khorom la si.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":905,"row":{"en":"[The people begin to chant, We want to be heard! We want to be heard!]","wo":"[Nit ñi tàmbali di way, Danu bëgg ñu dégg nu! Danu bëgg ñu dégg nu!]","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gni tambali di way, daniou beug gnou degue gnou! daniou beug gnou degue gnou!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":906,"row":{"en":"The Sinai Peninsula is located in the eastern part of Egypt and is home to the famous Mount Sinai, where Moses is said to have received the Ten Commandments.","wo":"Peninsule bu Sinai mingi féete ci wàllu penkug Egypt, foofu la Mont Sinai bu siiw bi nekk, muy barab biñ wax ni fala Moussa jotee Fukki denkaane yuñ ko jox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPeninsule bou Sinai mingui fété si wallou penkoug Egypt, foofou la Mont Sinai bou siiw bi neuk, mouy barab bign wakh ni fala Moussa dioté Fouki denkaané yougn ko diokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":907,"row":{"en":"Hip-hop music video series highlighting top domestic, international, and pop-culture news each week.","wo":"Ay widewo misik hip-hop yu tegalantoo don fësal xibaru aada ak cosaan yu kër, ak yu internasional ayubës bu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy video music hip hop you tegalantou done feusal khibarou aada ak cosaan you keur ak you international ayubeuss bou nekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":908,"row":{"en":"It demanded at least a temporary solution to avoid benefit reductions.","wo":"Defa laajon ak lumu new new ab pexe ci ab diir ngir moytu njariñu koom bi di waññeku.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDéfa ladjon ak loumou new new ab pékhé thi ab diir nguir moytou ndiarignou kom bi di wagnékou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":909,"row":{"en":"Constance: I know what you mean. Sangeetha always makes me feel better when I'm having a bad day.","wo":"Constance: Xamnaa li nga bëgga wax. Sangeetha saa yu sama xol nàqaree ci bis moomay féexal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nConstance: Khamna li nga beuga wakh. Sangeetha sa you sama khol nakharé thi biss momay fékhale.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":910,"row":{"en":"They're just a way to get from one place to another.","wo":"Dañu joge ci benn barab, dem ci beneen barab.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou djogué thi bene barab, dem thi beneen barabé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":911,"row":{"en":"However, I always take care to preserve the poem's original meaning and intent.","wo":"Waaye, danga wara bàyyi xel waroo soppi lenn ci li taalif bëgga wax wala wundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé daga wara bayi khél waro sopi léne si li taalif beuga wakh wala woundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":912,"row":{"en":"Myth and reality, the moody and the magnificent mingle to create the perfect backdrop for bloody murder.","wo":"Léeboon wala dëggantaan, ki baax ak ki bon lañu boole ngir sos ngir nas ray gu ñaaw googu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLébone wala deuguentane ki bakh ak ki bone lagnou boolé nguir sos nguir nass ray gou niaw gogou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":913,"row":{"en":"Person A: I think we should start our own perfume company. We could create fragrances that are truly original and that reflect our personality.","wo":"Nit A: Damani ndax jotul nu tàmbali defar sunu parfum bopp. Dina nu mën defar parfum yu wuute ak yeneen yi xet te dina fësal li nu bëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit A: Damani ndakh diotoul gnou tambali defar souniou parfum bopp. Dina gnou meun defar parfum you wouté ak yenen yi khet té dina feusal li gnou beug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":914,"row":{"en":"When taken regularly in therapeutic doses, ginger root can effectively cure nausea;","wo":"Sudee dangay faral di naan ginger ci anam wuy faje, mën na faj xel mu teey;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé dangaye faral di nane ginger si anam wuy fadié, meun na fadj khel mou téyé;\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":915,"row":{"en":"I smiled back. You're welcome. I sat down next to her bed and took her hand.","wo":"Ma itam ma muuñ. Yaay boroom. Ma daal di toog ci wetam ci lal bi, daal di jël loxoom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa itam ma mougn. Yaye borom. Ma daldi togue ci wetam ci lal bi daldi dieul lokhoom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":916,"row":{"en":"I walk to work, and I play basketball once or twice a week.","wo":"Dina dox te dinaa def basket benn wala ñaari yoon ci ayu-bis bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina dokh té dina def basket benn wala gnari yone thi ayoubiss bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":917,"row":{"en":"She smiled when she saw them. They're beautiful, she said. Thank you.","wo":"Mu gis ko daal di muuñ nima, Flër yi rafet nañu, jërëjëf waay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou guiss ko daldi mougn nima fleur yi rafet nagnou dieuredieuf wayé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":918,"row":{"en":"But people still seem to need them.","wo":"Waaye daa melni nit ñi dañu leen soxla.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé da melni nitt gni daniou len sokhla.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":919,"row":{"en":"Isaac Newton observed objects falling and eventually proposed gravity.","wo":"Isaac Newton dafa xool mbir yuy daanu jaare fa tàmbale wax waxi gravite.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nIsaac Newton dafa khol mbir youy daanou diarée fa tambalé wakh wakhi gravité.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":920,"row":{"en":"Other organisations engaged in statistics are welcome to join this collaborative model.","wo":"Yeneen mbootaay yiy yengu ci lim ak xayma yebalnañulen ngir ñu bokku ci xeetu lëkkaloo bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYenen mbooteey yiy yeungou thi lim ak xayma yebal nagnoulen nguir gnou bokou si xeetou leukaloo bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":921,"row":{"en":"The Mahdi's rule was short-lived, and Sudan was reconquered by the British in 1898.","wo":"Nguuru Mahdi yàggul dara, waa Grande Bretagne daal di ñëw nangu Sudan ci 1898.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgourou Mahdi yaggoul dara, wa grande bretagne daldi nieuw nangou soudan thi 1898.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":922,"row":{"en":"Candy tells George and Lennie about his dream of one day owning a small farm, and the three men decide to pool their money together to buy a farm.","wo":"Candy nettali George ak Lennie, mébetam am toolu boppam bu ndaw, ñoom ñatti jël dogalu boole seen xaalis ngir mën jënd benn tool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCandy netali George ak Lennie, mébetam ame toolou bopam bou ndaw, gnom gniati dieul dogalou boolé seen khaliss nguir meune dieund bene tool.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":923,"row":{"en":"She's always picking on me and making me do all the worst jobs.","wo":"Dafa dal sama kaw saa yu nekk, dëkk dima jox liggéey yi gëna bon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa dale sama kaw sa you nek deuk dima diokh liguey yi geuna bone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":924,"row":{"en":"His slightly hooked nose, sharp, almost black eyes, and shoulder-length hair gave him a harsh appearance.","wo":"Bakkanam bu xawa sëgg ba noppi cate, bëtam yu xawa ñuul ak kawaram gu wàxci ba ci mbagg yi dako doon melokaan wu raglu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBakkanam bou khawa seugg ba noppi caté, beutam you khawa nioul ak kawaram gou wakhthi ba thi mbagg yi dako done melokane wou raglou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":925,"row":{"en":"Real art is about showing the world as it is, warts and all.","wo":"Art dëgg mooy wane àdduna bi, ci nimu mel dëgg, li rafet ak lu ñaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nArt deug moy wané addouna bi ci nimou mel deug li rafet ak lou niaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":926,"row":{"en":"We use them for a few minutes and then discard them, never giving a thought to the environmental consequences.","wo":"Danu leen di jëfandikoo ci diir bu gàtt ba noppi sànni leen, te dañu bàyyi xel ci loraange yi mu mëna jural àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanio léne di dieufandiko si dir bou gat ba nopi sani léne té daniou bayi khél si lorangé yi mou meuna dioural addouna bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":927,"row":{"en":"You posted a picture of yourself wearing that green rag on social media.","wo":"Danga publiye sa foto boo sol sagar bu wert ci reso sosio yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanga publier sa foto bo sol sagar bou wert si réseau sosio yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":928,"row":{"en":"The pastry chef was skeptical at first, but she agreed to give it a try.","wo":"Xalaat boobu dalul woon xelu jabar ji, ba yàgg muni na jéem ba xam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalaat bobou daloul wone khelou djabar dji ba yague mouni na djiém ba kham.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":929,"row":{"en":"By making small changes in our daily lives, we can help to conserve water and ensure that this vital resource is available for future generations.","wo":"Sunu amaale coppite yu ndaw ci ni ñuy dundee bis bu nekk, dina nu mëna sakkanal xéewal gii di ndox suko defee ndaw yiy ñëw ëlëg mën ci am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou amalé coppité you ndaw thi ni gnouy doundé bis bou neuk, dina gnou meuna sakkanal khéwal gui di ndokh souko défé ndaw yiy nieuw euleuk meun thi ame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":930,"row":{"en":"The gallant groom is a well-known citizen of Shelby, a mining engineer by profession, and a most excellent gentleman.","wo":"Jëkkër bu joŋe bi ab doomu Shelby bu siiw lool la, ab insiñër ci liggeyu mine, te nekk ab góor gu baax waay lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieukeure bou diongué bi ab domou shelby bou siiw lool la, ab ingénieur ci ligueyou mine, té nek ab goor gou bakh way lool.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":931,"row":{"en":"Desperate to flee this nightmare, I ran to the back of the room and perched on a little pink stool.","wo":"Daw rek laa bëggoon, ma daw ba fi néeg bi yam ma langaamu ci taboure bu rose bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaw rek la beugone ma daw ba fi négg bi yam ma langamou si tabouré bou rose bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":932,"row":{"en":"Seller will select method of shipment, unless Customer gives timely, prior written instructions.","wo":"Jaaykat bi dina tann nuñuy yobboo ci gaal, wa ilaa klian bi joxe ci teel, ay mbind digle.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiaykat bi dina tane nuniouy yobou thi gaal wa ila client bi diokhé thi tayl ay mbine digle.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":933,"row":{"en":"As we noted, wrath can be open and obvious or subtle and hidden, and it can acquire targets unrelated to the source.","wo":"Ni ñu ko gise, muur mënna doon lu ubbeeku mbaa lu nëbbu, te mënna am ay resilta yu wute ak sursu bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNignou ko guissé, muur meuna done lou ubéku mba lou neubou té meuna ame ay résilta you wouté ak sursou bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":934,"row":{"en":"You may also want to have someone help you hold your dog still.","wo":"War nga am ku lay jàppal xaj bi mu baña yëngu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWar nga ame koulay diapal khadj bi mou bagna yeungou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":935,"row":{"en":"Rods are responsible for night vision, while cones are responsible for color vision.","wo":"Batonet yi ñoo yor wàll xoolum guddi, cone yi ñooy xàmmee kulër yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBatonet yi gno yor wall kholoum goudi, cone yi gnoy khamé couleur yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":936,"row":{"en":"The German Luftwaffe also developed a number of high-altitude bombers, including the Heinkel He 177 Greif and the Messerschmitt Me 264 Amerika Bomber.","wo":"Luftwaffe bu Allemagne itam defar nañu bombardier yuy naaw lu kawe, lu ci melni Heinkel He 177 Greif bi ak Messerschmitt Me 264 Amerika Bomber.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLuftwaffe bou allemagne itam defar nagnou bombardier youy naw lou kawé, lou thi melni Heinkel He 177 Greif bi ak Messerschmitt Me 264 Amerika Bomber.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":937,"row":{"en":"Nobody deserves a victory lap anymore for software that just lets machines talk amongst themselves.","wo":"Kenn gënul yelloo ñu delloo ko njukkal ci wàllu xarala kudul fexe ba masin yi di wax seen biir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKen gueuneul yello gnou dello ko ndioukal si wallou kharala koudoul fexé ba masin yi di wakh seen biir.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":938,"row":{"en":"We’ll be glad to provide expert advice to assist you with how much you can comfortably afford to borrow.","wo":"Dina nu kontaan lool ci joxe dénkaane yu lalu ci xam-xam wax la ba ñaata nga mëna leb te dula sonal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina gnou contane lol thie diokhé dénkane you lal thi kham kham wakh la ba gnata nga meuna leub té doula sonal\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":939,"row":{"en":"* 1/2 teaspoon baking powder","wo":"* 1/2 kuddu kafe levure chimique","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n1/2 koudou café levure chimique\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":940,"row":{"en":"When the dal makhani was finished, the students sat down to eat.","wo":"Bi ndongo yi toggee dal makhani bi ba noppi, ñu toog di lekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi ndongo yi togué dal makhani bi ba nopi, gnou togue di lekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":941,"row":{"en":"I closed my eyes and prepared for death.","wo":"Ci laa tëj samay bët di waajal dee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi la teudj samay beut di wadial dé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":942,"row":{"en":"Replacement teachers discovered notes in classrooms containing offensive messages.","wo":"Jàngalekat biy wuutu, gis na saaga yu ko ndongo yi bind ci biir klaas yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJangalékat biiy woutou, guiss na sagga youko ndongo yi bind thi biir classe yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":943,"row":{"en":"I am the Golden Apple Tree, the tree said. And now that you have eaten my apple, you will be cursed.","wo":"Garab gi dellu niko, Man maay Garabu Pommu wurus, yaa lekk sama pomme, dina am lula dal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGarab gui dellou niko, Man may Garabou Pomme wou wourouss, yaa lekk sama pommé, dina ame loula dale.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":944,"row":{"en":"They can cause a variety of symptoms, including pain, burning, and frequent urination.","wo":"Barina anam yumu mëna feeñee, lu ci melni metit, tàng, wala di saw lu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina anam youmou meuna fégneu, lou thi melni métite, tang, wala di saw lou bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":945,"row":{"en":"Frederick helps Constance to heal from her grief, and he gives her the strength to raise her children on her own.","wo":"Frederick jàppale Constance mu jéema fàtte nàqar wi ci xolam, ba noppi may ko doole ju muy mëna yoree ay doomam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFrederik djapalé constance mou djéma faté nakhar wi thi kholam, ba nopi mayko dolé dji mouy meuna yoré ay domam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":946,"row":{"en":"No competent lawyer wants to put a hostile witness on the stand, even under oath.","wo":"Amul benn àttekat bu bëgga woo ci àttekaay bi seede bu ànd ak mbañeel, doonte daa waat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoul ben attekat bou beuga woo ci attekay bi seedé bou and ak mbagneel donté daa waat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":947,"row":{"en":"But even in the midst of our heartbreak, there is hope.","wo":"Waaye ci diggu naqar sax, yaakaar amna ci.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé thi digueu nakhar sakh yakar amna thi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":948,"row":{"en":"Pineapple sage (Salvia elegans) is an underrated herb in the garden.","wo":"Sauge ananas (Salvia elegans) ñax la muñu joxul cëram ci jardin bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSauge ananas (Salvia elegans) gnakh la mouniou diokheul ceuram thi jardin bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":949,"row":{"en":"He had so much fun helping his mother that he decided that he wanted to be a chef when he grew up.","wo":"Amoon na mbégte ci jàppale yaayam ci waañ ba sax wax ni su màggee daf bëgga nekk toggukat bu mag.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmona mbegteh sii diapaleh yayame sii wagn ba sah wakh ni sou mageh daf beuga neuk toguekat bou mag.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":950,"row":{"en":"The young soldier lay on the battlefield, bleeding from a wound in his side.","wo":"Soldaar bu ndaw baa ngi tëdd ci toolu xare bi, dañu ko gaañ ci wet muy nàcc.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoldat bou ndaw ba ngui teudd thi toolou kharé bi, daniou ko gagne thi wet mouy nath.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":951,"row":{"en":"Then outline the picture with a pencil or pen so that the image is imprinted on the mug.","wo":"Ginaaw loolu nga jël crayon wala bik nga rëdd nataal so ko defee ñu mën ko imprime ci kaas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw lolou nga dieul crayon wala bic que nga reudd nataal so ko défé gnou meun ko imprimer si kaas.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":952,"row":{"en":"The next day, Esteban asked Marcela what she thought of the song.","wo":"Ca ëlëg sa Esteban laaj Marcela numu gisee way wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThia euleuk sa esteban ladj marcela noumou guissé way wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":953,"row":{"en":"But we're worried that it's going to fall and hurt someone! cried an eagle.","wo":"Céeli bi wax, Waaye danuy ragal mu daanu am kumu gaañ!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCéeli bi wakh wayé daniouy ragal mou danou ame koumou gaagne !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":954,"row":{"en":"With a ladle, he or she can ladle out a steaming bowl of soup or sauce.","wo":"Ak luus bi, mën na tànq ñeex mu tàng wala supp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAk luuss bi meun na tankh gnekh mou tang wala soupe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":955,"row":{"en":"He demanded a bribe from Krishnan, and when Krishnan refused to pay, Ramasamy threw him in jail.","wo":"Muni fàww Krishnan jox ko xaalis, bi ko Krishnan baña jox xaalis, Ramasamy daal di koy yóbbu tëj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui ni faww Krishnan diokh ko khalis, bi ko Krishnan bagna diokh khalis, Ramasamy daal dikoy yobou teudj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":956,"row":{"en":"It’s the factor why persistent intestinal concerns may trigger foggy brain, insomnia, or depression.","wo":"Moo waral ay jafe jafe butit mënna faj lu mel ni yùur buy fùur, ñakk nelaw, mbaa sutante xel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoo waral ay diafé diafé boutit meuna fadj lou melni youre bouy foure, gnak nelaw, mba souteunté hel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":957,"row":{"en":"Perhaps it is their beauty, with their sleek coats and flowing manes.","wo":"Amaana seen taar ak seen kawar gu rafet giy daanu moo ciy ray nit ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmaana seen taar ak seen kawar gou rafet gui daanou mo ciy raye nitt gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":958,"row":{"en":"Then, in the darkness, they saw it: a strange, glowing light.","wo":"Nis tuut, mu am luma gis ci lëndëm gi: lu melni làmp bu leer di ñëw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiss touti mou ame louma guiss thi leundeum gui lou melni lampe bou leer di gneuw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":959,"row":{"en":"He would often take bribes from the people he arrested, and he would also use his power to harass and intimidate people.","wo":"Dafay faral di nangu xaalis biñ koy geree jogee ci ñi mu jàpp, te dafay jëfandikoo darajaam di yuuxu wala di jéem a napp nit ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafay faral di nangou khalis bign koy geré djogué thi gni mou diap té dafay dieufandiko daradiaam di youkhou wala di djiém a nap nitt gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":960,"row":{"en":"It is illegal in most countries, but enforcement is often lax.","wo":"Yoon daf koy tere ci réew yu bari, waaye duñu faral di tege ay daan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYoon dafay teré si rew you bari wayé dougnou faral di tegué ay dane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":961,"row":{"en":"I took it to the curb and put it out for the trash.","wo":"Ma génne ko ci trotoire bi, bàyyi ko fa muy mbalit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa guéné ko si trotoire bi, bayi ko fa mouy mbalite.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":962,"row":{"en":"No matter how you enjoy it, you are sure to love this fruit salad.","wo":"Yaa xam nooy jëlee salad de fruit bi, waaye sooko ñamee doo ko bàyyi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaa kham noy dieulé salad de fruit bi wayé soko gnammé doko bayi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":963,"row":{"en":"A light rainstorm might produce only a few inches of rain, while a heavy rainstorm can produce over a foot of rain.","wo":"Taw bu woyof ay pouce yu néew lay am, waaye su